# Mississippi BEAD subgrantee selection

December 4, 2024

The Mississippi Department of Finance and Administration (DFA) has announced the initial subgrantee selections for the Broadband Expansion & Access for Deployment (BEAD) Program, following a rigorous competitive application process. These organizations have been selected to deploy broadband to unserved and underserved locations across Mississippi.

The selections represent a significant step toward closing the digital divide in Mississippi and are subject to final contracting and program requirements.

The following organizations have been selected as initial BEAD subgrantees:

* Comcast Cable Communications, LLC
* Delta Telephone Company of Mississippi, Inc.
* Home Telephone Company
* MPower Communications, Inc.
* North East Mississippi Electric Power Association (NEMEPA)
* Pine Belt Telephone Company
* Pioneer Telephone Company
* South Central Telephone Association, Inc.
* Southwest Mississippi Electric Power Association
* TeleCove Operations, LLC
* Tombigbee Electric Power Association
* Tombigbee Fiber, Inc.

